// "More in" links: the other pages in this article's hub group.
const HERE = "/black-friday-home-gym-deals/";
const HUB = SECTIONS.find((s) => s.slug === "home-gym");
const GROUP = HUB?.groups.find((g) => g.pages.some((p) => p.url === HERE)) ?? HUB?.groups[0];
const MORE = (GROUP?.pages ?? []).filter((p) => p.url !== HERE).slice(0, 6);
---

<Layout
  title={`${title} | Treadmill Reviews USA`}
  description={description}
  ogType="article"
  article={{
    publishedTime: "2026-10-28",
    modifiedTime: "2026-10-28",
    author: "Shaheer Ali Khan",
    section: "Fitness Equipment",
    tags: [
      "black friday fitness deals",
      "black friday home gym deals",
      "black friday exercise equipment",
      "black friday gym equipment",
      "home gym deals 2026",
      "adjustable dumbbells black friday",
      "rowing machine black friday",
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
  stickyCta={{ text: "Treadmill to Watch: Horizon T101 Connect", link: PRODUCTS[0].amazonUrl }}
>
  <article class="ed-article" data-template="editorial">
    <div class="ed-col">
      <nav class="ed-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/home-gym/">Home Gym</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        <span>Black Friday 2026</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">Black Friday Home Gym Deals 2026</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Black Friday 2026 is on 27 November, and nobody has published their prices yet. What you can do now is choose the equipment, write down what it sells for today, and decide the price at which you will buy. Here are seven home gym products on Amazon worth watching, one per category, with the prices we saw in October and the figure we would wait for.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
          By <a href="/editorial-standards/#who" rel="author">Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD</a><br />
          Updated October 28, 2026 · Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist · ACSM-EP, CSCS
        </div>
        <a href="#top-picks" class="btn-ghost">View products</a>
      </div>
      <p class="ed-disclosure">
        We research every product on this page independently. If you buy through our links, we may earn a
        commission at no cost to you. <a href="/editorial-standards/">Learn more about how we review.</a>
      </p>

      <figure class="ed-hero">
        <div class="ed-hero-collage">
          <a href="#horizon-t101-connect"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31pAWKay09L._SL500_.jpg" alt="Horizon T101 Connect" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#rep-quickdraw"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41H7lu9oLRL._SL500_.jpg" alt="REP Fitness QuickDraw Adjustable Dumbbells" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#schwinn-ic4"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41s6fwc-DRL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Schwinn IC4" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
        </div>
        <figcaption>Horizon T101 Connect · REP Fitness QuickDraw Adjustable Dumbbells · Schwinn IC4</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          "Black Friday fitness deals" covers everything from a $20 foam roller to a $3,000
          bike, and the discounts behave differently in each corner of that range. Dumbbells and
          plates barely move. Connected cardio machines move a lot, often through bundles. Racks
          go on sale in brand-run windows that start weeks before Black Friday. This page picks one
          product we would watch in each of seven categories, records what it sold for in October,
          and explains what a real deal looks like for each.
        </p>

        <section id="top-picks" class="ed-toppicks not-prose">
